# Reflected light (GI) through a turn of the camera: the probes of -gi 1 live on while they are off the screen (step 2b
# of the ray-tracing revisit, reports/render-features/2026-11-08-rt-revisit/step-2b.md). The plank hut of gi-clips at
# noon, view hut-day-2: the camera stands 1 s, turns 180 degrees round the hero at once, stands 3 s, turns back and
# stands 2 s. `uv run scripts/gi_compare.py --turn <out>/hut-turn.mp4` compares the frame before the turn with the
# first frame after the return, cell by cell.
#   OPENGOTHIC_RT=1 OPENGOTHIC_GI=1 TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=2560x1440 BENCH_HOST=ryzen scripts/bench.sh gi-turn
seed 73013
cheat god
overlay off
ui off
view full
cam lift off

set time 12 0
goto NW_CITY_HABOUR_POOR_AREA_HUT_01_IN
clear 3000
watch player
cam look 110
cam world 180 170 180
wait 10000
rec hut-turn
wait 1000
cam cut
cam world 180 170 0
wait 3000
cam cut
cam world 180 170 180
wait 2000
stop
